244
00:16:11,237 --> 00:16:12,272
Safer.
ປອດໄພກວ່າເກົ່າ.

245
00:16:12,839 --> 00:16:14,147
But...
ແຕ່...

246
00:16:14,307 --> 00:16:17,982
Oh. And this is amazing. I can control
